{"title":"Stoneborn","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\">A level 22 Skeleton that attacks with ? (melee).</p>\n      <h2>Fighting it</h2><div class=\"s\"><i>Weak</i> <span class=\"tag-chip weak\">crush</span><span class=\"tag-chip weak\">burn</span></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">A weakness adds 15% damage (the game's own rule). Monsters have no resistances.</p>\n      \n      \n      <h2>Levels</h2><div class=\"q-picker\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Level\"><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/stoneborn\">All levels</a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/stoneborn?lv=22\">Lv 22</a><a class=\"q-chip on\" href=\"#/monster/stoneborn?lv=25\">Lv 25 <span>5</span></a></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">The same monster spawns at different levels, and its hitpoints, damage and XP follow its level (the game’s own formula). In the game a monster more than 5 levels above you shows its level as “???”.</p>\n      <div class=\"g-scroll\"><table class=\"g-table q-table\"><thead><tr><th>Level</th><th>HP</th><th>Damage</th><th>XP</th><th>Elite (HP · dmg · XP)</th><th>Seen</th><th>Mostly</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/stoneborn?lv=22\" title=\"Pick level 22\"><td><b>22</b> <span class=\"muted\">(base)</span></td><td>74</td><td>16.6</td><td>1,100</td><td class=\"muted\">222 · 23.2 · 3,300</td><td><span class=\"muted\">—</span></td><td><span class=\"muted\">—</span></td></tr><tr class=\"q-row-on\" data-href=\"#/monster/stoneborn\" title=\"Show all levels\"><td><b>25</b></td><td>89</td><td>null</td><td>1,250</td><td class=\"muted\">267 · 0 · 3,750</td><td>5</td><td><span class=\"muted\">—</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n      \n      \n      \n      <h2>Drops</h2><div class=\"collector-extra collector-monster-drops\"><b>Observed drops</b><div class=\"muted\">No kills of this monster reported yet; 1 looted corpse recorded.</div><div style=\"margin-top:8px\"><b>Normal loot</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"gold-coin\" title=\"Gold Coin - 1 recorded drop, 39 total, 39 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/2216cc0344c9d30bb3ee.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Gold Coin</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1<br>×39</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"arrow\" title=\"Arrow - in 1 of 1 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 2 total, 2 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/f8e0f872cc502e1dabe7.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Arrow</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1<br>×2</span></div></div></div><div class=\"muted\" style=\"margin-top:8px\">Drop rate as 1/X (about 1 kill in X drops it, counted over the corpses whose loot was recorded; kills nobody looted are not counted), and ×N, how many come in one drop.</div></div>\n      \n      <h2>Where to find it</h2><p class=\"muted\">No sightings yet.</p>\n      \n      <h2>Related</h2><p>Other Skeleton: <a href=\"#/monster/skeleton\">Skeleton</a> <span class=\"muted\">(7)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/drowned-crewman\">Drowned Crewman</a> <span class=\"muted\">(15)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/skeleton-man-at-arms\">Skeleton Man-at-Arms</a> <span class=\"muted\">(36)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/skeleton-knight\">Skeleton Knight</a> <span class=\"muted\">(40)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/grave-knight\">Grave Knight</a> <span class=\"muted\">(44)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/knight-commander\">Knight-Commander</a> <span class=\"muted\">(47)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/virikh\">Virikh</a> <span class=\"muted\">(50)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/virikh-templar\">Virikh Templar</a> <span class=\"muted\">(53)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/virikh-lord\">Virikh Lord</a> <span class=\"muted\">(56)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/virikh-dragonslayer\">Virikh Dragonslayer</a> <span class=\"muted\">(58)</span></p>\n      <p class=\"wp-guides\"><b>Guides:</b> <a href=\"#/guide/combat\">Combat</a> · <a href=\"#/guide/monster-families\">Monster families</a> · <a href=\"#/guide/monsters-by-level\">Monsters by level</a></p>\n    </div><aside class=\"wp-infobox\"><div class=\"wp-pic\"><img src=\"data/img/gen/b1d0c342dcf93a55383a.svg\" alt=\"Stoneborn\"></div><h3>Stoneborn</h3><table>\n      <tr><th>Level</th><td><b>25</b> <span class=\"muted\">(picked · base 22)</span></td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Family</th><td>Skeleton</td></tr><tr><th>Attacks</th><td> · melee</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Hitpoints</th><td>89</td></tr><tr><th>XP</th><td>1,250</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Attack speed</th><td>4.3 s</td></tr><tr><th>Attack range</th><td>1.6</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Aggressive</th><td>Yes (7 tiles)</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Drops gems</th><td>Yes</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Seen</th><td>4 times</td></tr>\n    </table></aside></article>"}